@1 = ~Fish, fish, and more fish! I hate fish! Can't I eat something else for once? Just once! If you have any food, please share. Sharing is caring, after all!~
@2 = ~I have some meat. Will you pay 20 gold for it?~
@3 = ~I have some sausage. Will you pay 50 gold for it?~
@4 = ~I have some cookies. Will you pay 67 gold for it?~
@5 = ~I have some honey. Will you pay 78 gold for it?~
@6 = ~I have some eggs. Will you pay 43 gold for it?~
@7 = ~No food? I suppose it's fish again.~
